    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">A comprehensive policy covering 100 % of the declared value of the shipment. The insurance, regulated by the Insurance Regulatory and Development Authority of India (IRDAI), protects against accidental collisions, fire, theft, natural calamities, and even unforeseen delays that could jeopardise the safety of your items.</p>
